    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thats a fair summary but it feels a bit vague. when u say \"enhanced security\" or \"faster throughput,\" is there actually evidence that this stuff works well in practice? or is it just something proponents claim to justify the rollout?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
